<title>USA: Ocurest sees Q1 net loss, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Ocurest sees Q1 net loss, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocurest Laboratories Inc said Wednesday it will report a net loss for the first quarter 1997 as a result of the continued investment in marketing programs.</p>
<p>The company also said preliminary sales for the first quarter, ended March 31, 1997, rose to $453,000, a 33 percent increase from the $340,263 reported in the same period last year.</p>
